===persian===

گناه از نَخِ آب بود
که شوقِ مرا...
بر پیکر تو گره زد...
خواب‌هایم آشفته تر از آنست که...
باران را از دوشِ آب تمیز دهم...
با نخ‌های تابیدهٔ آب...
بر تو بسته شدم...
و چشم‌های تَرَم...
در حسرت بوسه خشک شد...
ای ابر خوب...
درهوای من ببار و خاک مرا تر کن
تو... بر من ببار...
گرهٔ آب را... خاک باز می‌کند...
۱۳۸۳

===machine===

The fault lay with the thread of water
that knotted my longing...
onto your body...
My dreams are too tangled for me...
to tell the rain from the shower of water...
With the twisted threads of water...
I was bound onto you...
and my wet eyes...
went dry with longing for a kiss...
O good cloud...
rain into my air and wet my earth,
you... rain down on me...
The knot of water... the earth unties...
1383

===lantern===

The fault lay with the thread of the water
that knotted my longing
onto your body.
My dreams are too tangled for me
to tell the rain from the shower of water.
With the twisted threads of water
I was bound onto you,
and my wet eyes
went dry with longing for a kiss.
O good cloud —
rain into my air and wet my earth.
You — rain down on me.
The knot of water is untied by the earth...

1383

